.TH "nvme_init_keep_alive" 9 "nvme_init_keep_alive" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_keep_alive \- Initialize passthru command for Keep Alive command
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_keep_alive
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Keep Alive command. All
command specific fields are reserved.
